WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.092
Three objects fall under gravity,

2
00:00:02.092 --> 00:00:05.039
9.81 metres per second squared.

3
00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:07.787
First impact at 0.23 seconds,

4
00:00:07.787 --> 00:00:09.780
at 2.2 metres per second.

5
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.243
Peak contact force: 401.9 newtons.

6
00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:14.950
All objects came to rest.
